  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategy and organisation assessment for SDUB 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sociedade de Desenvolvimento Urbano da Beira (SDUB) is established in 2018. The mandate of SDUB is to provide pre-developed flood-proof land and stimulate associated construction for residential (Maraza) and industrial (Munhava) purposes in the City of Beira.The objective of this strategic assessment is to advice SDUB on an effective strategy for successful development of the projects within their portfolio, that enables the SDUB to become self-sufficient within three years. Priority is the realisation of the (affordable) housing project in Maraza, where 2.6 million euros has been invested in an area of 3.5 hectares. This area is backfilled, plots are delineated and granted with secured land rights and basic infrastructure such as access roads, utilities and a drainage system are put in place. There is an urgency to realise the construction and selling of affordable housing.The assessment will analyse and advice on the best strategies for project portfolio of SDUB and on the optimalisation of the organisation&apos;s structure, finance management and human capacity to implement the strategies successfully.</narrative>
  </description>
